.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "2024" "libmyutils 0.4.1" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy a fixed number of bytes from a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include "mystfunctions.h"
int mystrncpy(char *dest, const char *src, int n);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mystrncpy
copies at most
.I n
bytes from
.I src
into
.IR dest .
If
.I src
is shorter than
.IR n ,
the remainder of
.I dest
is padded with null bytes.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of bytes written to dest.
